<title>FRANCE: Sodexho sees higher 1996/97 pre-except.</title>
<headline>Sodexho sees higher 1996/97 pre-except.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catering group Sodexho said on Tuesday it expected a 25 percent increase in pre-exceptional profit for the 1996/97 year ending in August to around 500 million francs and a 23 percent rise in earnings per share.</p>
<p>It gave the forecast in its 1995/96 earnings statement in which it reported a 41 percent rise in pre-exceptional profit to 401.2 million francs from 284.4 million the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
